      "text": "When  we add user defined class object in TreeSet\nthen it is called custom TreeSet .\n\n--> WAP to add Book class Object in TreeSet whose\nmembers are \n\n  a. BookName \n  b. Author\n  c. Price\n\nWhen we print TreeSet it must dislay sorted output\nbased on price .",
